Priority: optional
Description: openmediavault FileBrowser Quantum plugin
 Manage the FileBrowser Quantum web file manager (a modern fork of the
 archived FileBrowser) from the OpenMediaVault web interface. The Docker
 container is registered in the openmediavault-compose plugin, so it
 follows the Compose plugin conventions and can be inspected, edited and
 started on the Compose page; the plugin provides start/stop/restart/
 update buttons, reports the container state, the running version and
 available upstream updates and can open the web interface. Includes
 Chinese translations.
